WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:01.529
Why is Peru's coast a

2
00:00:01.529 --> 00:00:03.161
desert, right next to the

3
00:00:03.161 --> 00:00:05.061
ocean? A cold current runs

4
00:00:05.061 --> 00:00:06.194
along it.

5
00:00:06.510 --> 00:00:08.538
The oceans average about 35

6
00:00:08.538 --> 00:00:10.839
