7
00:00:10.839 --> 00:00:12.531
Evaporation raises it.

8
00:00:12.531 --> 00:00:14.598
Rivers and rain lower it.

9
00:00:14.913 --> 00:00:16.672
The warm Gulf Stream keeps

10
00:00:16.672 --> 00:00:18.591
